# Sales Data ETL Pipeline

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates an end-to-end ETL pipeline that extracts sales data,
transforms it using Python and Pandas, and loads it into a MySQL database.
The pipeline is automated using Apache Airflow.

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- MySQL
- Apache Airflow

## 🏗 Workflow
1. Extract sales data from CSV
2. Transform data (calculate total sales)
3. Load data into MySQL
4. Schedule and monitor using Airflow

## 🕒 Airflow DAG
- DAG Name: sales_etl_pipeline
- Schedule: Daily
- Tasks: Extract → Transform → Load

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Clone the repository
2. Create MySQL database using SQL script
3. Install dependencies
4. Run Airflow and trigger DAG

